K325T a1200-audrec: the audio flight recorder (K325T/aud_rec.v), debug
paula_audio_channel.v exports the channel's state (state, output byte, DMA enable, interrupt pending, the AMR
silence flags, DMA request, period / length counters, AUDxPER/LEN/VOL, data buffer, AUDxDAT) as dbg; paula_audio.v
and paula.v pass the four channels out as aud_dbg; minimig.v instantiates aud_rec on the register bus, the CPU's
custom / CIA-B strobes, IPL, the mix and aud_dbg, with the bridge configuration byte in (rec_cfg) and the readout
word out (rec_out); minimig_m65.v passes both.  Nothing drives back into the machine.
--- a/rtl/paula_audio_channel.v
+++ b/rtl/paula_audio_channel.v
@@ -18,7 +18,8 @@
